Joy-Con front-view illustration

Reference: Nintendo Switch Joy-Con illustration.svg
Original artist: 0 Noctis 0 (2017)
https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nintendo_Switch_Joy-Con_illustration.svg
https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/33/Nintendo_Switch_Joy-Con_illustration.svg

The original reference and the adapted illustrations in source/joycon_art.hpp
and assets/icon.svg (with its raster copy assets/icon.jpg)
are provided under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Adaptation: front-view silhouettes converted to NanoVG paths, rescaled and
mirrored for the right controller; controls simplified and redrawn for the
application display; body and control colors supplied by controller HID data.
The original artwork is retained in assets/joycon-reference.svg.

This illustration notice is separate from the LGPLv3 application code and
the bundled renderer licenses. No endorsement by the original artist or
Nintendo is implied.
